    <decisions>
        <name>Decide_Proof_Needed</name>
        <label>Proof Reference Filled For Method?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Create_Payment</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>OK to Proceed</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Cheque_Or_Bank_Without_Proof</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>PaymentMethodField</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Cheque</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>ProofReferenceField</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsBlank</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Screen_ProofRequired</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Cheque, No Proof</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Bank_Without_Proof</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>PaymentMethodField</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Bank Transfer</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>ProofReferenceField</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsBlank</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Screen_ProofRequired</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Bank Transfer, No Proof</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>ALF-RS-08 (LFRDN-338) FR12: Quick Action screen flow launched from a Vehicle Reservation to record its deposit payment. Asks the rep for only what they actually decide - Amount, Payment Method, Proof Reference, Payment Date - and derives everything else (Account, Contact, Opportunity, Quote, the Vehicle Reservation link, and a generated AF_SFPaymentReference__c) from the reservation itself. Replaces creating the Payment via the reservation&apos;s plain related-list New button, which asked the rep to manually re-enter Account and left AF_SFPaymentReference__c (a required, unique external-ID match key for the Keyloop integration - not something a rep should be inventing by hand) blank. Pre-flights the same Cheque/Bank-Transfer-needs-proof rule AF_VR_Payment_ProofRequired enforces at the database level, so a rep sees the problem before submitting rather than after.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Formula_GeneratedReference</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;PAY-&quot; &amp; {!Get_Reservation.Name} &amp; &quot;-&quot; &amp; TEXT(ROUND(({!$Flow.CurrentDateTime} - DATETIMEVALUE(&quot;1970-01-01 00:00:00&quot;)) * 86400, 0))</expression>
    </formulas>
